{
 "duration": 57.08,
 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "text": "A dead traffic light is a stop sign.",
   "end": 2.32
  },
  {
   "start": 2.32,
   "text": "But when four cars stop, do you know who goes first?",
   "end": 5.48
  },
  {
   "start": 5.48,
   "text": "That first part is New York law.",
   "end": 7.64
  },
  {
   "start": 7.64,
   "text": "The California DMV agrees.",
   "end": 9.74
  },
  {
   "start": 9.74,
   "text": "So does Florida law.",
   "end": 11.15
  },
  {
   "start": 11.15,
   "text": "Washington calls it an all-way stop.",
   "end": 13.61
  },
  {
   "start": 13.61,
   "text": "Watch this corner.",
   "end": 14.74
  },
  {
   "start": 14.74,
   "text": "The red pickup gets there first, so it goes first.",
   "end": 18.11
  },
  {
   "start": 18.11,
   "text": "Then the van. The last two stop at the same time.",
   "end": 21.43
  },
  {
   "start": 21.43,
   "text": "Nobody moves. Then a police officer steps in and raises a hand.",
   "end": 25.93
  },
  {
   "start": 25.93,
   "text": "Now the officer beats the stop sign.",
   "end": 28.46
  },
  {
   "start": 28.46,
   "text": "In New York, if an officer waves you through a stop sign, you go.",
   "end": 32.39
  },
  {
   "start": 32.39,
   "text": "California says follow their orders, even over the signals.",
   "end": 36.25
  },
  {
   "start": 36.25,
   "text": "Washington law names flaggers and firefighters too.",
   "end": 39.53
  },
  {
   "start": 39.53,
   "text": "The power comes back, blinking red.",
   "end": 41.95
  },
  {
   "start": 41.95,
   "text": "New York's DMV says that's a stop sign too.",
   "end": 45.15
  },
  {
   "start": 45.15,
   "text": "When it's dark, who goes first?",
   "end": 47.28
  },
  {
   "start": 47.28,
   "text": "Whoever the officer waves on.",
   "end": 49.26
  },
  {
   "start": 49.26,
   "text": "No officer? California's DMV says the first car there.",
   "end": 53.32
  },
  {
   "start": 53.32,
   "text": "A tie? Yield to the car on your right.",
   "end": 55.95
  },
  {
   "start": 55.95,
   "text": "It's dark again.",
   "end": 57.08
  }
 ],
